summary:
The Association’s new headquarters celebrates 75 years of American-Australian ties;

honors founder Sir Keith Murdoch and the Murdoch family, with support from News Corp, Fox Corporation and the Pratt Foundation

NEW YORK, March 15, 2023--(BUSINESS WIRE)--The American Australian Association, founded by Sir Keith Murdoch in 1948, is proud to launch the next era of the Association with the opening of its new headquarters in New York City. Named the American Australian Association Murdoch Center, i
